<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>동의 선택 최종 확인</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/public-consent.css"></head><body><main class="consent-shell"><section class="consent-card"><p class="kicker">FINAL REVIEW</p><h1>선택 내용을 최종 확인해 주세요</h1><p>제출 후에는 이 화면에서 응답을 변경할 수 없습니다.</p><ul class="review-list"><c:forEach var="item" items="${document.items()}"><li><strong><c:out value="${item.title()}"/></strong><span class="decision ${decisions[item.itemId()] == 'AGREE' ? 'agree' : 'disagree'}">${decisions[item.itemId()] == 'AGREE' ? '동의' : '미동의'}</span></li></c:forEach></ul><div class="actions"><a class="secondary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/consent/respond/${flow}">다시 선택</a><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/consent/respond/${flow}/submit"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><button class="primary">최종 제출</button></form></div></section></main></body></html>
